OL,3,GNEWSAThe Armagh apples connecting a
OL,4,Arural community
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the Orchard County of Armagh, where
OL,7,Fapple trees are part of the landscape,
OL,8,Feven some of the smallest Bramleys can
OL,9,Fbe the hardest to sell.
OL,11,FBut Joe Garvey has found a way to give
OL,12,Fsome of them a new purpose. He has
OL,13,Fspent almost 70 years working with
OL,14,Fapples and, after retiring, began
OL,15,Flooking for a way to reduce food waste
OL,16,Fwhile supporting older people in the
OL,17,Fvillage of Scotch Street.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
