OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThe Armagh apples connecting a
OL,4,Arural community
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat led to Macha's Orchard, a social
OL,7,Fenterprise producing apple juice and a
OL,8,Funique powder supplement from smaller
OL,9,Ffruit and parts of the apple that would
OL,10,Fotherwise be discarded.
OL,12,FThe project is helping to fund the work
OL,13,Fof Richmount Rural Community
OL,14,FAssociation, services Garvey describes
OL,15,Fas a "lifeline" for people living in
OL,16,Frural isolation.
